    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In the enemy [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), react immediately when an enemy completes a Fall Back. Pick a friendly unit with either keyword, **FLAYED ONES** or **DESTROYER CULT**. At phase start that unit must have been within [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of the retreating enemy. Roll 1D6. A 2–5 deals D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) to the enemy, and a 6 deals 3. On a 1 there is no damage from this roll. After rolling, your unit may pursue with a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move). Its final position must be as near to the retreating enemy as the rules allow.",
